<<<
PAIRS & SNARES. Of the large
===
**PAIRS & SNARES.** Of the large
>>>

<<<
To exemplify briefly, contemptuous & contemptible are a pair in which suffixes may be confused; masterful & masterly one in which differentiation may be wrongly ignored; & deprecate & depreciate one of the altogether false pairs.
===
To exemplify briefly, *contemptuous* & *contemptible* are a pair in which suffixes may be confused; *masterful* & *masterly* one in which differentiation may be wrongly ignored; & *deprecate* & *depreciate* one of the altogether false pairs.
>>>

